a </span><span begin="00:15.940" end="00:17.170">miracle</span><span begin="00:17.170" end="00:17.200">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.200" end="00:23.110"><span begin="00:17.200" end="00:17.440">To </span><span begin="00:17.440" end="00:17.860">get </span><span begin="00:17.860" end="00:18.370">away </span><span begin="00:18.370" end="00:18.760">from </span><span begin="00:18.760" end="00:18.820">you</span><span begin="00:18.820" end="00:18.820">, </span><span begin="00:18.820" end="00:18.910">away </span><span begin="00:18.910" end="00:19.720">from </span><span begin="00:19.720" end="00:23.020">you</span><span begin="00:23.020" end="00:23.110">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.110" end="00:27.160"><span begin="00:23.110" end="00:23.410">I </span><span begin="00:23.410" end="00:23.800">know </span><span begin="00:23.800" end="00:24.010">it's </span><span begin="00:24.010" end="00:25.660">chemica</span><span begin="00:25.660" end="00:25.690">-</span><span begin="00:25.690" end="00:26.620">-</span><span begin="00:26.620" end="00:26.830">ls</span><span begin="00:26.830" end="00:27.160">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.160" end="00:31.240"><span begin="00:27.160" end="00:27.370">I </span><span begin="00:27.370" end="00:27.820">need </span><span begin="00:27.820" end="00:27.910">a </span><span begin="00:27.910" end="00:28.510">mirac</span><span begin="00:28.510" end="00:28.540">-</span><span begin="00:28.540" end="00:28.660">-</span><span begin="00:28.660" end="00:30.910">le</span><span begin="00:30.910" end="00:31.240">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.240" end="00:34.570"><span begin="00:31.240" end="00:31.570">And </span><span begin="00:31.570" end="00:31.720">I'm </span><span begin="00:31.720" end="00:31.930">not </span><span begin="00:31.930" end="00:33.070">spiritual</span><span begin="00:33.070" end="00:33.280">,</span><span begin="00:33.280" end="00:33.490">but </span><span begin="00:33.490" end="00:33.940">please </span><s